p: .
t. 
|  This process was clearly intended to aid the investigation and presen-
|  tation of sex abuse charges, which by their nature tend to require the27
|  intervention of experts. But we have found that many (although not all)
|  of the auxiliary family court personnel are actually among the leading
.  contributors to the insanity of the courts


