t. 
|  For instance, one common way for auxiliary players to enter custody
|  litigation is through a judge’s order for a “home study” by the state’s CPS
|  agency. This sometimes occurs in conventional custody disputes but is
|  much more common when charges of sexual abuse are raised. In such
|  cases, all parties are likely to be evaluated, including the parent who
.  made the allegation

